-Nothing yet.
+### `check` with no path now looks at `.smysl/store`
+
+Every other command with no path reads stdin (rule P), which made `smysl check` alone in a
+project directory read an empty pipe rather than say anything about the project. `check` now
+falls back to `.smysl/store` when given neither a positional file nor `--store`; an explicit
+`-` still reads stdin, and `--store` still names its own path.
 
